Subject: [PATCH] TRAYZTHICK9050: HT9050 Tray Z layer pitch = the station's
 Tray Form thickness x100 -- EastSun 1008 (Teach 9050 Tray Z pitch 2300, Tray
 Form Type1 Thickness 7.62) 'use the yellow-box value for the red-box
 setting'.

cinitial.cpp W906_TrayZ9050 (same line): the pitch comes from W906_TrayZ9050Pitch (end of file) = UserDefForm_File[type].ZDepth * 100,
  golden's dbTrayThick conversion (7.62 mm -> 762). Loader = TrayForm.Loader, Empty = TrayForm.Empty, Auto1-3 = TrayForm.Auto[eAuto1..+2].
  Thickness 0 or a bad type -> the taught Tech.iTrayZ9050Pitch (unchanged behaviour).
csystem.cpp DoAllProcess (same line as FLOWTRACE): W906_TrayZ9050PitchSync, HT9050 only, writes the value in use back into
  Tech.iTrayZ9050Pitch[] so the Teach page shows it.
tests: test_flow9050_tray.cpp [TT] (11 checks), Flow9050_Tray 130/130. W6_3_CatchTray, W6_6_CSystemCycle, Flow9050_Shuttle,
  HT9050_ShtSafe / DryRun / ProdFlow / DualCoil, FP9050_Pure / Index passed. Debug and release linked.
Not in this commit: EastSun's own 08:46 asendic_Loader.cpp edit (C_Load_Up.Push() in DoLoad_9050 case 1100), left in his tree.
